"""

Main Snakefile for the RNA motif discovery pipeline.

Run snakemake in the root of this repository to execute the pipeline. The Snakefile will
load the configuration files in config/ , these are the main way to control the pipeline's behaviour.

See run_snakemake.sh for an example of how to run the pipeline via Slurm with a specific configuration.

You can either change the final output you want to produce in the rule all: section below, or run snakemake with. specified target,
e.g. snakemake results/00_controls/rfam/family_phylo_summary.tsv, to run the postive control pipeline.

"""

